+ *   thread 0188  holds the Win32 process heap section (a game allocation at
+ *                re9.exe+0x2533E6), and waits for CodeInvalidationMutex --
+ *                RtlAllocateHeap grows the heap under its own section, the
+ *                allocation notification reaches
