+ *   - CodeCache::EnableLoadedSection, which publishes translated code into the
+ *     lookup cache and marks guest ranges executable.
+ *   - CTX.AddForceTSOInformation, which asserts the mutex is held
+ *     (Interface/Core/Core.cpp:1066) and mutates the ForceTSO structures that
+ *     GenerateIR reads under the shared lock (Core.cpp:580-581).
